# Account ids that get owner/admin powers (the owner-only sandbox switch,
# admin moderation, owner-only views). One id per line; '#' comments and
# blank lines are ignored.
#
# A Discord identity is prefixed "discord:", a bare number is a Google sub.
# Copy this file to owner_subs.txt (which is gitignored) and fill in real ids.
#
# discord:123456789012345678
# 111111111111111111111
